# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Get started {#get-started}"
msgstr "Mulai {#get-started}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Find access information for this Qiskit Function in the [Qiskit Functions Catalog](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/functions).\n"
msgstr "Temukan informasi akses untuk Qiskit Function ini di [Qiskit Functions Catalog](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/functions).\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "This section shows how to authenticate and load the function, and how to prepare a problem in the dictionary format that SQOA Solver accepts by using `OptimizationProblem` from [qiskit-addon-opt-mapper](https://qiskit.github.io/qiskit-addon-opt-mapper/). The examples that follow run the function and read the result.\n"
msgstr "Bagian ini menunjukkan cara autentikasi dan memuat function, serta cara menyiapkan masalah dalam format dictionary yang diterima SQOA Solver dengan memakai `OptimizationProblem` dari [qiskit-addon-opt-mapper](https://qiskit.github.io/qiskit-addon-opt-mapper/). Contoh-contoh berikutnya menjalankan function dan membaca hasilnya.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Authenticate and load the function {#authenticate-and-load-the-function}"
msgstr "Autentikasi dan muat function {#authenticate-and-load-the-function}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "First, authenticate with your [IBM Quantum API key](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/). (The following code assumes that you already [saved your account](/guides/functions-get-started#install-qiskit-functions-catalog-client) to your local environment.) Then, create a catalog client as follows:\n"
msgstr "Pertama, lakukan autentikasi dengan [API key IBM Quantum](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/)-mu. (Kode berikut mengasumsikan kamu sudah [menyimpan akunmu](/guides/functions-get-started#install-qiskit-functions-catalog-client) di environment lokal.) Lalu buat catalog client seperti berikut:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Prepare the input with `qiskit-addon-opt-mapper` {#prepare-the-input-with-qiskit-addon-opt-mapper}"
msgstr "Siapkan input dengan `qiskit-addon-opt-mapper` {#prepare-the-input-with-qiskit-addon-opt-mapper}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "This guide models problems with the `OptimizationProblem` class of [qiskit-addon-opt-mapper](https://qiskit.github.io/qiskit-addon-opt-mapper/). SQOA Solver accepts a QUBO problem as a coefficient dictionary in the tuple-string format used by IBM optimization functions, so every example in this guide follows the same client-side preparation pattern:\n"
msgstr "Panduan ini memodelkan masalah dengan kelas `OptimizationProblem` dari [qiskit-addon-opt-mapper](https://qiskit.github.io/qiskit-addon-opt-mapper/). SQOA Solver menerima masalah QUBO sebagai dictionary koefisien dalam format tuple-string yang dipakai oleh function optimisasi IBM, jadi setiap contoh di panduan ini mengikuti pola persiapan sisi klien yang sama:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Write the model.** Create an `OptimizationProblem`, add binary decision variables, and set the objective and any constraints.\n"
msgstr "**Tulis model.** Buat `OptimizationProblem`, tambahkan variabel keputusan biner, lalu atur objektif dan kendala apa pun.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Convert to QUBO.** Convert the problem with `OptimizationProblemToQubo`, which adds any constraints to the objective as penalty terms and returns an equivalent unconstrained minimization problem.\n"
msgstr "**Ubah ke QUBO.** Ubah masalah dengan `OptimizationProblemToQubo`, yang menambahkan kendala apa pun ke objektif sebagai suku penalti dan mengembalikan masalah minimisasi tanpa kendala yang ekuivalen.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Bullet: '3. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Convert to a dictionary.** Pass the QUBO to the `to_problem_dict()` helper function defined in the next section, and pass the result to `solver.run()` as `problem`, together with `variable_type=\"binary\"`.\n"
msgstr "**Ubah ke dictionary.** Berikan QUBO ke fungsi helper `to_problem_dict()` yang didefinisikan di bagian berikutnya, lalu berikan hasilnya ke `solver.run()` sebagai `problem`, bersama `variable_type=\"binary\"`.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "SQOA Solver always minimizes a dictionary problem, which matches the minimization problem that `OptimizationProblemToQubo` returns. For a maximization problem, the returned `objective_value` is therefore the negative of the original objective. To read the result in terms of the original problem, evaluate the returned assignment with `OptimizationProblem`, as the examples show. For the dictionary format details, see [Accepted problem formats](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/functions/jij-sqoa-solver#accepted-problem-formats) in the API reference.\n"
msgstr "SQOA Solver selalu meminimalkan masalah berbentuk dictionary, yang sesuai dengan masalah minimisasi yang dikembalikan `OptimizationProblemToQubo`. Jadi, untuk masalah maksimisasi, `objective_value` yang dikembalikan adalah negatif dari objektif aslinya. Untuk membaca hasil dalam bentuk masalah aslinya, evaluasi penugasan yang dikembalikan dengan `OptimizationProblem`, seperti yang ditunjukkan contoh. Untuk detail format dictionary, lihat [Accepted problem formats](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/functions/jij-sqoa-solver#accepted-problem-formats) di referensi API.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Define the following helper function once and reuse it in every example. It converts the QUBO returned by `OptimizationProblemToQubo` into the dictionary format. The keys use the variable indices of the QUBO, so the solution keys `x_0`, `x_1`, and so on in the result correspond to those indices. Every variable receives a linear entry, even with a zero coefficient, so that the returned solution covers all variables.\n"
msgstr "Definisikan fungsi helper berikut sekali dan pakai ulang di setiap contoh. Fungsi ini mengubah QUBO yang dikembalikan `OptimizationProblemToQubo` ke format dictionary. Key-nya memakai indeks variabel dari QUBO, jadi key solusi `x_0`, `x_1`, dan seterusnya pada hasil sesuai dengan indeks tersebut. Setiap variabel mendapat entri linear, bahkan dengan koefisien nol, supaya solusi yang dikembalikan mencakup semua variabel.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Example 1: MaxCut on a 3-regular graph {#example-1-maxcut-on-a-3-regular-graph}"
msgstr "Contoh 1: MaxCut pada graf 3-regular {#example-1-maxcut-on-a-3-regular-graph}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Many graph problems, such as MaxCut, are NP-hard and are natural candidates for quantum optimization. Install `networkx` as an additional dependency to run this example:\n"
msgstr "Banyak masalah graf, seperti MaxCut, bersifat NP-hard dan menjadi kandidat alami untuk optimisasi kuantum. Instal `networkx` sebagai dependensi tambahan untuk menjalankan contoh ini:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "1. Write the model {#1-write-the-model}"
msgstr "1. Tulis model {#1-write-the-model}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Assign a binary variable $x_v \\in \\{0, 1\\}$ to each vertex of a graph $G = (V, E)$ to indicate its side of the cut. An edge is cut when its endpoints are on different sides, so the cut size is:\n"
msgstr "Tetapkan variabel biner $x_v \\in \\{0, 1\\}$ untuk setiap simpul graf $G = (V, E)$ untuk menunjukkan sisi potongannya. Sebuah sisi (edge) terpotong ketika kedua ujungnya berada di sisi yang berbeda, sehingga ukuran potongan adalah:\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\mathrm{Cut}(x) = \\sum_{(u,v) \\in E} \\left(x_u + x_v - 2 x_u x_v\\right).\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\mathrm{Cut}(x) = \\sum_{(u,v) \\in E} \\left(x_u + x_v - 2 x_u x_v\\right).\n"
"$$\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "This objective is already a QUBO without constraints, so `OptimizationProblemToQubo` only turns the maximization into the equivalent minimization and keeps the variables unchanged. The `Maxcut` application class in `qiskit_addon_opt_mapper.applications` builds the same model with `Maxcut(G).to_optimization_problem()`.\n"
msgstr "Objektif ini sudah berupa QUBO tanpa kendala, jadi `OptimizationProblemToQubo` hanya mengubah maksimisasi menjadi minimisasi yang ekuivalen dan membiarkan variabelnya tidak berubah. Kelas aplikasi `Maxcut` di `qiskit_addon_opt_mapper.applications` membangun model yang sama dengan `Maxcut(G).to_optimization_problem()`.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "2. Run the solver {#2-run-the-solver}"
msgstr "2. Jalankan solver {#2-run-the-solver}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Convert the model to a QUBO and then to a dictionary, and submit it. `problem` and `variable_type` are required. `backend_name` is optional. When it is omitted or `None`, the function selects the least busy operational QPU available to your instance.\n"
msgstr "Ubah model menjadi QUBO lalu menjadi dictionary, dan kirimkan. `problem` dan `variable_type` wajib diisi. `backend_name` bersifat opsional. Saat dihilangkan atau bernilai `None`, function memilih QPU operasional yang paling tidak sibuk yang tersedia untuk instance-mu.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The `options` dictionary accepts `shots`, `seed`, `session`, `postprocessing_level`, and `job_tags`. For descriptions and defaults, see the [API reference](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/functions/jij-sqoa-solver).\n"
msgstr "Dictionary `options` menerima `shots`, `seed`, `session`, `postprocessing_level`, dan `job_tags`. Untuk deskripsi dan nilai default, lihat [referensi API](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/functions/jij-sqoa-solver).\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "3. Retrieve the result {#3-retrieve-the-result}"
msgstr "3. Ambil hasil {#3-retrieve-the-result}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "`job.result()` returns a dictionary with four keys:\n"
msgstr "`job.result()` mengembalikan dictionary dengan empat key:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "`solution` is the complete variable assignment, keyed by `x_i`, where `i` is the variable index (for example, `x_3`).\n"
msgstr "`solution` adalah penugasan variabel lengkap, dengan key `x_i`, di mana `i` adalah indeks variabel (misalnya, `x_3`).\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "`objective_value` and `feasible` are the objective and feasibility of that assignment, evaluated on the submitted dictionary.\n"
msgstr "`objective_value` dan `feasible` adalah nilai objektif dan kelayakan dari penugasan tersebut, yang dievaluasi pada dictionary yang dikirim.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "`metadata` holds `solver_info` and `resource_usage`.\n"
msgstr "`metadata` berisi `solver_info` dan `resource_usage`.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Because the QUBO is the minimization form of MaxCut, `objective_value` is the negative of the cut size. Evaluate the assignment on the original `OptimizationProblem` to read the cut size directly.\n"
msgstr "Karena QUBO adalah bentuk minimisasi dari MaxCut, `objective_value` adalah negatif dari ukuran potongan. Evaluasi penugasan pada `OptimizationProblem` asli untuk membaca ukuran potongan secara langsung.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "4. Check the resource usage {#4-check-the-resource-usage}"
msgstr "4. Periksa pemakaian resource {#4-check-the-resource-usage}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "`result[\"metadata\"][\"resource_usage\"]` reports the time spent in each execution phase. Phases other than `RUNNING: EXECUTING_QPU` report `CPU_TIME`, the wall-clock time of the phase in seconds, when it is available.\n"
msgstr "`result[\"metadata\"][\"resource_usage\"]` melaporkan waktu yang dihabiskan di setiap fase eksekusi. Fase selain `RUNNING: EXECUTING_QPU` melaporkan `CPU_TIME`, yaitu wall-clock time fase tersebut dalam detik, jika tersedia.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The `RUNNING: EXECUTING_QPU` phase reports `QPU_TIME`, the QPU usage of all Quantum Compute jobs of the run, if the final usage is available for every job. For details, see the [API reference](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/functions/jij-sqoa-solver).\n"
msgstr "Fase `RUNNING: EXECUTING_QPU` melaporkan `QPU_TIME`, yaitu pemakaian QPU dari semua job Quantum Compute pada proses tersebut, jika pemakaian akhir tersedia untuk setiap job. Untuk detailnya, lihat [referensi API](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/functions/jij-sqoa-solver).\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Example 2: Convert a constrained problem to QUBO {#example-2-convert-a-constrained-problem-to-qubo}"
msgstr "Contoh 2: Ubah masalah berkendala menjadi QUBO {#example-2-convert-a-constrained-problem-to-qubo}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "SQOA Solver accepts unconstrained problems. This example shows how to convert a constrained problem into a QUBO with `OptimizationProblemToQubo` and map the result back to the variables of the original problem.\n"
msgstr "SQOA Solver menerima masalah tanpa kendala. Contoh ini menunjukkan cara mengubah masalah berkendala menjadi QUBO dengan `OptimizationProblemToQubo` dan memetakan hasilnya kembali ke variabel masalah asli.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "`OptimizationProblemToQubo` adds the constraints to the objective as penalty terms and converts the problem to minimization. The appropriate penalty weight is problem-dependent.\n"
msgstr "`OptimizationProblemToQubo` menambahkan kendala ke objektif sebagai suku penalti dan mengubah masalah menjadi minimisasi. Bobot penalti yang tepat bergantung pada masalahnya.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "After the run, `interpret()` maps the QUBO assignment back to the variables of the original problem.\n"
msgstr "Setelah dijalankan, `interpret()` memetakan penugasan QUBO kembali ke variabel masalah asli.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Evaluate the objective and the feasibility on the original problem. For a dictionary problem, the `feasible` field of the result refers only to the variable domain, because the dictionary has no constraints.\n"
msgstr "Evaluasi objektif dan kelayakan pada masalah asli. Untuk masalah berbentuk dictionary, field `feasible` pada hasil hanya merujuk pada domain variabel, karena dictionary tidak punya kendala.\n"

